    "custom_liquid_cfAz7N": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "disabled": true,
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"product-listbase\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"col-md-8\">\n        <!-- Tabs -->\n        <div class=\"tabs-page\">\n          <ul class=\"tab-buttons\">\n            <li><a href=\"javascript:void(0);\" onclick=\"showtab('AboutProduct',this);\" class=\"active\">Anti Ageing</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"javascript:void(0);\" onclick=\"showtab('Whykairali',this);\">Why Kairali?</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Anti Ageing Tab Content -->\n        <div id=\"AboutProduct\" class=\"tabcontent\" style=\"display: block;\">\n          <div class=\"antiage-wrapper\">\n            <h2>What is Anti-Ageing?</h2>\n            <p>Anti-ageing is a process of retaining, delaying, and stopping the ageing process which usually deteriorates with time. It is very important for us to keep a regular check on the causes or factors that might deteriorate our skin. There are many natural ways that can help us keep our skin healthy and supple.</p>\n\n            <h3>What are the Skin-Ageing Signs?</h3>\n            <p>Our skin changes with age, but there are various other reasons like climate, dry weather, improper diet, and lifestyle habits that make our skin liable to premature ageing. We can notice initial signs like wrinkles, fine lines, and visible dark spots. Biologically, our body undergoes natural changes, but we can manage external ageing factors to slow down the visible effects.</p>\n\n            <h3>Signs of Ageing</h3>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Wrinkles</li>\n              <li>Fine lines</li>\n              <li>Dark spots</li>\n              <li>Pigmentation</li>\n              <li>Drooping upper eyelids</li>\n              <li>Patchy skin</li>\n              <li>Dull and sagging skin</li>\n              <li>Open pores</li>\n            </ul>\n\n            <h3>Factors of Ageing According to Ayurveda</h3>\n            <p>Many factors lead to changes in our skin and body. These may be natural or external, but when unmanaged, they become harmful in the long run:</p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Stress</li>\n              <li>Improper Diet</li>\n              <li>Poor lifestyle</li>\n              <li>Lack of proper sleep</li>\n              <li>Lack of nourishment</li>\n              <li>Lack of hydration</li>\n            </ul>\n\n            <p><strong>Aahaar (Diet)</strong> is a major issue that must be corrected and followed daily, as proper food impacts overall skin health. Ayurveda sees food as medicine.</p>\n            <p><strong>Vihaara (Lifestyle)</strong> includes early rising, light exercise, warm water, regular sleep, and avoiding junk—all contributing to healthy ageing.</p>\n\n            <h3>Solutions in Ayurveda by Kairali Ayurvedic Products</h3>\n            <p>To address common skin issues, Kairali introduces Ayurvedic skincare solutions for youthful, radiant skin:</p>\n            <ul>\n              <li><strong>Kaircin:</strong> Ayurvedic facial night serum</li>\n              <li><strong>Kairpack:</strong> Ayurvedic face pack for soft, supple skin</li>\n              <li><strong>Kairkare:</strong> Body massage oil for detoxifying and de-stressing</li>\n              <li><strong>Kairbal:</strong> Ayurvedic cleansing powder for glowing skin</li>\n            </ul>\n\n            <h3>Why Internal Detox Matters</h3>\n            <p>Skin health begins from within. Detoxifying the body regularly helps prevent dullness and flakiness. Spices like turmeric, fennel, coriander, and fenugreek can improve internal health. Yoga and meditation support healthy, glowing skin.</p>\n\n            <h3>Key Ingredients Used by Kairali Ayurvedic Products</h3>\n            <p>Kairali has been producing Ayurvedic health solutions since 1908 using 100% natural ingredients:</p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Saffron</li>\n              <li>Lotus</li>\n              <li>Green gram</li>\n              <li>Sandalwood</li>\n            </ul>\n\n            <p><strong>Kaircin:</strong> A nourishing oil with saffron and lotus that revives youthful glow.</p>\n            <p><strong>Kairpack:</strong> Herbal face pack with anti-inflammatory ingredients for blemish-free skin.</p>\n            <p><strong>Kairbal:</strong> Natural exfoliating scrub that removes dead skin and impurities.</p>\n            <p><strong>Kairkare:</strong> Herbal massage oil for fitness and stress relief used for decades by Kairali.</p>\n\n            <h3>Ayurvedic Tips for an Effective Skin Care Regime</h3>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Eat seasonal vegetables</li>\n              <li>Sip herbal or green tea</li>\n              <li>Practice yoga or exercise regularly</li>\n              <li>Get 7–8 hours of sound sleep</li>\n              <li>Drink 8–10 litres of water daily</li>\n              <li>Take regular Ayurvedic therapies</li>\n              <li>Smile and stay happy</li>\n            </ul>\n\n            <p>For expert support or consultation, please <strong>contact us</strong>. Use Ayurvedic products under the guidance of certified Ayurvedic doctors.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Why Kairali Tab Content -->\n        <div id=\"Whykairali\" class=\"tabcontent\">\n          <div class=\"antiage-wrapper\">\n            <h2>Why Kairali?</h2>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Kairali is a Trusted Brand.</li>\n              <li>It’s best in Ayurveda.</li>\n              <li>Kairali is a top award-winning company.</li>\n              <li>It operates in 35 locations in 9 countries across 3 continents.</li>\n              <li>Kairali uses top quality raw materials and follows international guidelines while manufacturing products.</li>\n              <li>Guaranteed quality and safety – Kairali is dedicated to enhancing the good name of Ayurveda and follows strict development protocols.</li>\n              <li>Government certified – GMP certified by Tamil Nadu, Karnataka, and Kerala governments.</li>\n              <li>Research and development – A strong team of Ayurvedic physicians and chemists.</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Toggle Script -->\n<script>\n  function showtab(tabId, element) {\n    var tabs = document.querySelectorAll(\".tabcontent\");\n    var links = document.querySelectorAll(\".tab-buttons a\");\n\n    tabs.forEach(tab => tab.style.display = \"none\");\n    links.forEach(link => link.classList.remove(\"active\"));\n\n    document.getElementById(tabId).style.display = \"block\";\n    element.classList.add(\"active\");\n  }\n</script>\n\n<!-- CSS -->\n<style>\n.product-listbase {\n  padding: 40px 0;\n  font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\n  color: #333;\n}\n.tabs-page ul.tab-buttons {\n  display: flex;\n  list-style: none;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: 0 0 20px;\n  border-bottom: 2px solid #eee;\n}\n.tabs-page ul.tab-buttons li {\n  margin-right: 20px;\n}\n.tabs-page ul.tab-buttons a {\n  display: block;\n  padding: 10px 15px;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #444;\n  border-bottom: 3px solid transparent;\n  transition: 0.3s ease;\n}\n.tabs-page ul.tab-buttons a.active {\n  border-color: #c59d5f;\n  color: #c59d5f;\n}\n.tabcontent {\n  display: none;\n}\n.antiage-wrapper {\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  padding: 20px 30px;\n  max-width: 1000px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  text-align: justify;\n}\n.antiage-wrapper h2,\n.antiage-wrapper h3 {\n  color: #c59d5f;\n  margin-top: 30px;\n  margin-bottom: 15px;\n}\n.antiage-wrapper p {\n  margin-bottom: 15px;\n}\n.antiage-wrapper ul {\n  margin: 15px 0;\n  padding-left: 20px;\n}\n.antiage-wrapper ul li {\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n  list-style: disc;\n}\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .tabs-page ul.tab-buttons {\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  .tabs-page ul.tab-buttons li {\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n.antiage-wrapper {\n    padding: 15px 20px;\n  }\n}\n  .antiage-wrapper h2, .antiage-wrapper h3 {\n    font-size: 18px;\n  }\n}\n</style>"
      }
    },
    "flex_content_section_himanshu_GVzxX4": {
      "type": "flex-content-section-himanshu",
