        "tab_content_YrWHaj": {
          "type": "tab_content",
          "settings": {
            "tab_1_title": "Post Pregnancy",
            "tab_1_content": "<h1><strong>Post Pregnancy</strong></h1><p>This reaching at the top and winning attitude has made everyone ignore the natural routine that one should follow to maintain a healthy body. Work pressure leads to bad and improper eating habits which makes the body lose its grip and face problems. In today's tough and fast schedule women after pregnancy couldn't take good care of themselves to get to the normal body routine and hence faces problems with time. There are many non-herbal syrups and medications that are available in the market which promises cure but do not provide last long treatment. As the world has become ultra-competitive it's getting difficult for everyone to maintain their body properly with right type of nutrients and clothes. As we age our body ages as well and start facing problems. But through using Kairali's naturally created medication with the help of Ayurveda could provide benefits to you that you cannot even imagine. Several factors that results in breast sagging are multiple pregnancies; breast feeding, rapid weight loss, gravity and age.</p><p>In ancient India Ayurveda was the medication which was used by people for their treatment. Ayurveda was completely herbal and involved natural traditions of maintaining the body. Kairali sustained its ways of ancient Ayurveda in the roots of India and provided most trusted and herbal Ayurvedic treatment for the body. In today's unnatural lifestyle and improper attention towards ourselves causes many body and health related issues includes breast ptosis, which occurs from a loss of supporting tissue and fat in the breasts. This common condition causes round, globular breasts to morph into flatter, thinner breasts. During this slow process, the nipples may also relocate and move downward. Breast firmness can be improved with bust-lifting exercises, a good diet and supportive garments.</p><h2><strong>Doctor Recommended Solution for Post Pregnancy</strong></h2><p>Kairali is trying every day to make natural herbal Ayurvedic medication with new age technology and recommends you 'Dhanwantharam Kashayam', 'Dasamoolarishtam', 'Jeerakadyarishtam, Kairkare'. It will help you recover faster from the changes and problems that you face post pregnancy and will help you regain the strength of the uterus.</p><p>'Dhanwantharam Kashayam' strengthens the uterine muscles. This Ayurvedic medication provides nourishment to the entire reproductive system and acts as a general tonic for women in labour.</p><p>'Dasamoolarishtami' shows its remarkable effect in promoting general strength and immunity. It is even highly prescribed during old age and post-natal care.</p><p>'Jeerakadyarishtam' is used broadly as uterine- tonic after delivery. 'Jeerakadyarishtam' contains special ingredients like 'Jeeraka', 'Shunti', 'Mustha' which helps in providing cure for anorexia, indigestion, flatulence, abdominal distension and other gastric disorders which are common after delivering a child. It would also make milk for your child thicker and healthier.</p><h3><strong>Recommended Products:</strong></h3><ul><li>Take 3 spoons of '<strong>Dhanwantharam Kashayam</strong>' with 9 teaspoon of water twice daily. (Before meal)</li><li>Take 15 ml of '<strong>Dasamoolarishtam</strong>' and 'Jeerakadyarishtam' with 30 ml of water. (After breakfast)</li><li>Use '<strong>Kairkare</strong>' body oil daily.</li></ul>",
            "tab_2_title": "Why Kairali?",
            "tab_2_content": "<h2><strong>Why Kairali?</strong></h2><ul><li>Kairali is a Trusted Brand.</li><li>Its best in Ayurveda.</li><li>Kairali is a top award winning company.</li><li>It operates in 35 locations in 9 countries across 3 continents.</li><li>Kairali uses top quality raw material and follow international guidelines while manufacturing products. Good quality hygiene is maintained while processing which makes us one of the best in the world.</li><li>Guaranteed quality and safety – Kairali is dedicated towards enhancing the good name of Ayurveda and follow strict parameters in development of its products and its treatment.</li><li>Government certified – Our facilities are certified with GMP (Good manufacturing practices) by the government of Tamil Nadu, Karnataka and Kerala.</li><li>Research and development – Kairali's research and development team has great Ayurvedic physicians and new age chemists with years of experience and expertise.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
